# One change to HQ: mapped, built by workers in parallel, integrated and gated in one place, with each lesson fed back into the rules.
title: Building HQ with agents
direction: down

Map [icon: monitor, note: read only · classes · file owners]

# The layout draws this group's last member first, so B, C, A reads A, B, C.
Workers [dashed] {
  hq-worker B [icon: bot, note: own worktree · own files]
  hq-worker C [icon: bot, note: own worktree · own files]
  hq-worker A [icon: bot, note: own worktree · own files]
}

Main session [icon: terminal, anchor, note: lands each branch]
Gates [icon: shield, note: fast · check · browser · drift]
Pull request [icon: code, note: CI runs the same tasks]
Rules [icon: key, note: AGENTS.md · skills]

Map > Workers: one brief each
Workers > Main session: commits · report · lessons
Main session > Gates > Pull request
Main session --> Rules: a lesson becomes a rule [dashed]
Rules --> Workers: the next brief starts there [dashed]
